            "name": "Slingshot Cowboy VR",
            "steam_appid": 681920,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Ever wanted to tip a cow? Well, this is yer lucky day, partner. With our magic slingshot you can tip all them mad cows as they amble across your screen. Find out just how much mischief you can cause with a slingshot - if you're good that is!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNot so good with slingshot? Then grab a stone and throw it all the way across the field - unruly bulls and mischievous gophers won't wait. And if you want to cause some real mayhem try the Superweapon - loud and powerful Flare Gun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSlingshot Cowboy VR offers:<br />\r\n- Quality VR experience and fun soundtracks<br />\r\n- Intuitive aiming and shooting with 3 shooting modes for 3 different weapons - slingshot, throwable stones and flare gun<br />\r\n- 16 levels with increasing difficulty<br />\r\n- Bonus-carrying Gophers<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls: Use one Vive controller to grab a slingshot and another one to pull back on the rubber band and launch stones. The farther back you pull, the farther your stone will fly! Or just pick a stone from the box with you Vive controller and throw it. Or grab a flare gun and just shoot it pistol style.",
            "about_the_game": "Ever wanted to tip a cow? Well, this is yer lucky day, partner. With our magic slingshot you can tip all them mad cows as they amble across your screen. Find out just how much mischief you can cause with a slingshot - if you're good that is!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNot so good with slingshot? Then grab a stone and throw it all the way across the field - unruly bulls and mischievous gophers won't wait. And if you want to cause some real mayhem try the Superweapon - loud and powerful Flare Gun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSlingshot Cowboy VR offers:<br />\r\n- Quality VR experience and fun soundtracks<br />\r\n- Intuitive aiming and shooting with 3 shooting modes for 3 different weapons - slingshot, throwable stones and flare gun<br />\r\n- 16 levels with increasing difficulty<br />\r\n- Bonus-carrying Gophers<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls: Use one Vive controller to grab a slingshot and another one to pull back on the rubber band and launch stones. The farther back you pull, the farther your stone will fly! Or just pick a stone from the box with you Vive controller and throw it. Or grab a flare gun and just shoot it pistol style.",
            "short_description": "Fun colorful game for all ages and any mood. Nice graphics and fun mechanics make up quality VR experience you won't easily forget. Pull the sling or throw stones at will to reach the score and if it's not enough - make it loud with the flare gun!",
